 <section id="overview" class="doc-section"><h2>WoW on your Mac. Controls on your phone.</h2><p>WoW stays on your Mac. Thumble sends the sticks, buttons and triggers you use on your phone to the Mac receiver over the same Wi-Fi. ConsolePort manages the in-game actions and modifier layers.</p><p>The built-in ConsolePort controller works without an AI agent or cloud account. Thumble is a controller, not a game-streaming app.</p></section>
 <section id="requirements" class="doc-section"><h2>Before you begin</h2><ul><li>A Mac running macOS 15 or later, with WoW installed.</li><li>A ConsolePort release that supports the exact WoW installation you play.</li><li>The Thumble phone app on your iPhone or Android phone. Public phone downloads are coming soon.</li><li>Your phone and Mac connected to the same Wi-Fi. Guest networks may prevent devices from connecting.</li></ul><p>Add the recommended <a href="#thumble-addon">Thumble companion addon</a> for Mac gamepad recovery and synced ConsolePort spell labels. Keep your keyboard and mouse available while setting up WoW.</p></section>
 <section id="compatibility" class="doc-section"><h2>Requirements and release scope</h2><p>Documentation updated October 26, 2026. These requirements describe the current offer; they are not a test certificate for every WoW client.</p><ul><li><strong>Mac:</strong> macOS 15 or later, Apple silicon or Intel. The Mac receiver download is available.</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> iPhone and Android apps are being prepared for public release. You need the phone app as well as the receiver to use phone controls.</li><li><strong>ConsolePort:</strong> install a release for the exact WoW client you launch. Read the <a href="/guides/consoleport-mac-setup">ConsolePort installation guide for Mac</a>.</li><li><strong>Thumble companion addon:</strong> the documented 0.1.2 release supports Classic Era 1.15.9. This does not establish support for every Retail, Forever or Classic client. See the <a href="/guides/install-thumble-wow-addon">release selection and installation guide</a>.</li><li><strong>Connection:</strong> both devices use the same Wi-Fi. Thumble sends controls; it does not stream the game.</li></ul><p>Choosing between phone controls and a physical gamepad? Start with <a href="/guides/wow-controller-mac">WoW controller options on Mac</a>.</p></section>
