 <section id="dictation" class="doc-section"><h2>WoW chat from your phone</h2><p>Use the phone’s Chat controls to type or dictate a message. Review and edit the text before sending it. Dictation depends on your device, language and microphone/speech permissions.</p><p>Keep WoW focused and your phone connected. Chat delivery uses your configured game chat route and requires remaining connected-use time or Pro. Try a short message during setup before relying on chat in a session.</p></section>
 <section id="pricing" class="doc-section"><h2>30 minutes to try it in WoW</h2><p>The demo includes <strong>30 minutes total of connected controller use</strong> across sessions. It does not refill daily. ConsolePort controls, stick calibration and dictation are included.</p><p>Setup screens, menus, offline practice, and time paused or disconnected do not consume the allowance. An active connected controller counts down even while idle or composing chat.</p><p><strong>Thumble Pro is a one-time $19.99 USD in-app purchase for unlimited controller time.</strong> No subscription. Local store prices may vary. The phone app and Pro purchase are coming soon.</p><p>If you already own Pro, use Restore Purchases with the same store account. Internet access is needed for purchase verification. Check your remaining time before a session; demo expiry stops live input and chat delivery.</p></section>
 <section id="troubleshooting" class="doc-section"><h2>If something doesn’t work</h2><ul><li><strong>Cannot pair:</strong> check the same Wi-Fi, local-network permission and a fresh QR code. Guest networks may isolate devices.</li><li><strong>Paired, but no input:</strong> start or resume the controller, check demo time or Pro access, and confirm ConsolePort is enabled for the WoW client you launched.</li><li><strong>After a receiver restart:</strong> pair again. The <a href="#thumble-addon">Thumble addon</a> can refresh Mac gamepad discovery with ConsolePort enabled, outside combat after neutral controls. If the addon is unavailable or WoW still does not see the gamepad, pause input and refresh gamepad detection in WoW using <code>/console GamePadEnable 0</code> followed by <code>/console GamePadEnable 1</code>, then resume and retest in a quiet place.</li><li><strong>Wrong action:</strong> check ConsolePort’s binding and active modifier layer for that character.</li><li><strong>Reversed camera:</strong> open Stick calibration in the Thumble menu.</li></ul><p>Still stuck? <a href="/support">Contact support</a> with your WoW client, ConsolePort version, phone and macOS versions, and what you observed.</p></section>
