-</head><body class="home-page launch-page current-docs"><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Thumble home">thumble<span class="brand-period">.</span></a><nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/guides">Guides</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/docs">Setup guide</a><a href="/#download">Download</a></nav></header><main id="main" class="section-shell"><section class="docs-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Thumble</p><h1>About Thumble</h1><p class="lede">Phone gamepad controls for World of Warcraft on Mac, built by Cody Bontecou.</p></section><section class="docs-copy" style="max-width:780px;margin:40px auto 90px"><h2>What Thumble does</h2><p>Thumble turns your phone into a gamepad for World of Warcraft on your Mac. The Mac runs the game, ConsolePort manages in-game bindings, and the phone sends stick, button, shoulder and trigger input over the same Wi-Fi. Thumble Receiver is the Mac companion that delivers this input to the game.</p><h2>Who it is for</h2><p>Thumble is for WoW players on macOS 15 or later who want ConsolePort-style controls on their phone. Choose a ConsolePort release compatible with your exact WoW client. Thumble does not stream WoW to a phone. Windows and Linux receivers are not available.</p><h2>Availability and pricing</h2><p>The free signed and notarized Mac receiver is available now. The phone app is coming soon. The phone app offers a 30-minute total connected-use demo; the planned $19.99 USD one-time Pro unlock removes that time limit. No AI account is required for the built-in ConsolePort controller.</p><h2>Business contact</h2><p>Thumble, 76-6182 Lehua Rd, Kailua-Kona, HI 96740, United States. Email <a href="mailto:codybontecou@gmail.com">codybontecou@gmail.com</a> for support.</p><h2>Built by Cody Bontecou</h2><p>For installation help, compatibility questions or feedback, use the <a href="/support">support page</a>. Read the <a href="/docs">setup guide</a>, <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, and <a href="/terms">terms</a> before getting started.</p></section></main><footer class="site-footer section-shell"><a class="brand" href="/">thumble<span class="brand-period">.</span></a><span>WoW on your Mac. Controls on your phone.</span><span class="footer-links"><a href="/guides">Guides</a><a href="/docs">Setup guide</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/waitlist">Launch updates</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/support">Support</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/developers">Developers</a></span><small>© <span id="year">2026</span> Thumble</small></footer></body></html>
